# Production values for `expo export`. Committed deliberately.
#
# Everything here is EXPO_PUBLIC_*, which Expo inlines into the JavaScript
# bundle that every visitor downloads. These values are already public the
# moment the site is live — the anon key especially, which exists to be shipped
# to browsers. Keeping them out of git protects nothing and breaks builds on any
# host that does not pass build-time variables through.
#
# Row level security is what makes the anon key safe to publish: it grants no
# access to any table. See migration 0003.
#
# NEVER put a real secret here. The service_role key, the database password and
# the Supabase JWT secret are server-side only and live in Railway's variables,
# never in this repository.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://clever-contentment-production-bcb7.up.railway.app
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://fdidttqeqwgozfuwdwjh.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJzdXBhYmFzZSIsInJlZiI6ImZkaWR0dHFlcXdnb3pmdXdkd2poIiwicm9sZSI6ImFub24iLCJpYXQiOjE3ODg4MDc5NjAsImV4cCI6MjEwNDM4Mzk2MH0.44FCSRQ8xYwlX8W2KTzHEq8BT0S-3WGNkRqGMoRBpeU
